    "locales": {
      "en": {
        "name": "Blue Force Gear PLATEminus V2 Plate Carrier (Coyote Brown)",
        "shortName": "PLATEminus V2",
        "description": "The second-generation plate carrier from Blue Force Gear is designed to accommodate SAPI/ESAPI-format plates. Made from a water-resistant material with reduced infrared signature. Quick-release buckles allow the carrier to be removed instantly in critical situations. Its reinforced construction provides reliable protection in any combat conditions. Comes in a Coyote Brown color with a rather unique pouch setup."
      },
